WEBVTT

00:17:30.246 --> 00:17:35.288
my father would comfort me with soft pets
and kisses, but he would never lie.

00:17:37.121 --> 00:17:41.871
We all die, Susie, he would say.
It's normal to be scared.

00:17:42.871 --> 00:17:46.204
He didn't try to invent a buffer
between me and reality.

00:17:47.371 --> 00:17:49.204
It took me a while to understand

00:17:49.204 --> 00:17:51.788
the power of how he guided
me through those nights.

00:17:52.621 --> 00:17:56.663
What he showed me is that courage
is not an absence of fear.

00:17:57.954 --> 00:18:00.913
Courage is fear walking.